WEBVTT

00:13:58.062 --> 00:14:02.106
we can be more mindful
about the emotional cues

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:03.359
that we focus on,

00:14:03.383 --> 00:14:05.782
the outrage bait that we click on.

00:14:06.422 --> 00:14:07.602
But most importantly,

00:14:07.626 --> 00:14:12.127
we can stop seeing each other
as just members of the red team

00:14:12.151 --> 00:14:13.545
or the blue team.

00:14:13.959 --> 00:14:19.856
Because whether we are Christian,
Muslim, Jewish, atheist,

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:22.364
Democrat or Republican,

00:14:22.388 --> 00:14:23.544
we're human.

00:14:23.568 --> 00:14:24.843
We're human beings.

00:14:25.992 --> 00:14:29.494
And we often share really similar habits.